  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For infinite solution&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, then all planes are overlapping</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;option (d) is correct.</p><p>Put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;the system equations as,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Adding all three above equations we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;option (c) is correct.</p><p>Now, if&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;then,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp; (No solution)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;option (b) is correct.</p><p>Now, if&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;(unique solution exists)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;option (a) is incorrect</p>",
